# Whitelist: ignore everything, then re-admit only code and documentation.
# This repo holds METHODS. Data lives in S3 (see README).
*
!*/
# code
!*.sh
!*.py
# documentation
!*.md
# small text results that document what each stage produced
!SUMMARY_*.txt
!LENGTH_HIST.txt
!.gitignore
# never, under any circumstances
# infrastructure planning: account ids, quotas and spend. Keep it out of git.
# Needed here as well as at the repo root, because the deepest .gitignore wins
# and the !*.md above would otherwise re-admit it.
EC2_PLAN.md
**/EC2_PLAN.md
*.fa
*.fasta
*.fa.*
*.csv
*.tsv
*.zst
*.gz
*.pkl
*.cm
*.k2d
*.hist
*.runs
*.done
*.log
# upstream collaborator code + trained model: provenance is theirs, not ours
Lebowski/
# scratch
05_benchmarks/
step2/chunks/
step2/results/
step2/claims/
step2/rfam/
step3/
